// audioLow:    attack (0..1 = -100..100 %), sustain (0..1 = -100..100 %), live gain change (0..1 = -18..+18 dB), input level (-60..0 dB)
// audioMedium: input peak hold, output level, output peak hold (-60..0 dB), reserved
uniform float4 audioLow;
uniform float4 audioMedium;

float sdseg(float2 p, float2 a, float2 b) {
    float2 pa = p - a;
    float2 ba = b - a;
    float h = clamp(dot(pa, ba) / dot(ba, ba), 0., 1.);
    return length(pa - ba * h);
}
// Monoline sans-serif digit in a 1 x 2 box; d < 0 draws nothing.
float digit(float2 q, float d) {
    if (d < 0.) return 0.;
    float m = 10.;
    if (d < 0.5) {
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.25, 0.05), float2(0.75, 0.05)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.75, 0.05), float2(0.92, 0.35)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.92, 0.35), float2(0.92, 1.65)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.92, 1.65), float2(0.75, 1.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.75, 1.95), float2(0.25, 1.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.25, 1.95), float2(0.08, 1.65)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.08, 1.65), float2(0.08, 0.35)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.08, 0.35), float2(0.25, 0.05)));
    }
    else if (d < 1.5) {
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.18, 0.45), float2(0.55, 0.05)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.55, 0.05), float2(0.55, 1.95)));
    }
    else if (d < 2.5) {
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.1, 0.4), float2(0.25, 0.1)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.25, 0.1), float2(0.5, 0.05)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.5, 0.05), float2(0.75, 0.1)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.75, 0.1), float2(0.9, 0.4)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.9, 0.4), float2(0.85, 0.75)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.85, 0.75), float2(0.1, 1.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.1, 1.95), float2(0.92, 1.95)));
    }
    else if (d < 3.5) {
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.12, 0.12), float2(0.5, 0.05)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.5, 0.05), float2(0.85, 0.25)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.85, 0.25), float2(0.85, 0.65)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.85, 0.65), float2(0.45, 0.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.45, 0.95), float2(0.88, 1.25)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.88, 1.25), float2(0.9, 1.7)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.9, 1.7), float2(0.5, 1.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.5, 1.95), float2(0.1, 1.85)));
    }
    else if (d < 4.5) {
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.75, 1.95), float2(0.75, 0.05)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.75, 0.05), float2(0.05, 1.35)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.05, 1.35), float2(0.95, 1.35)));
    }
    else if (d < 5.5) {
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.9, 0.05), float2(0.2, 0.05)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.2, 0.05), float2(0.12, 0.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.12, 0.95), float2(0.5, 0.85)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.5, 0.85), float2(0.85, 0.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.85, 0.95), float2(0.92, 1.5)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.92, 1.5), float2(0.75, 1.9)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.75, 1.9), float2(0.45, 1.97)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.45, 1.97), float2(0.1, 1.8)));
    }
    else if (d < 6.5) {
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.85, 0.15), float2(0.5, 0.05)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.5, 0.05), float2(0.18, 0.35)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.18, 0.35), float2(0.1, 1.0)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.1, 1.0), float2(0.1, 1.6)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.1, 1.6), float2(0.4, 1.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.4, 1.95), float2(0.75, 1.9)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.75, 1.9), float2(0.92, 1.55)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.92, 1.55), float2(0.8, 1.15)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.8, 1.15), float2(0.45, 1.05)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.45, 1.05), float2(0.12, 1.3)));
    }
    else if (d < 7.5) {
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.08, 0.05), float2(0.92, 0.05)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.92, 0.05), float2(0.4, 1.95)));
    }
    else if (d < 8.5) {
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.5, 0.95), float2(0.15, 0.7)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.15, 0.7), float2(0.15, 0.3)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.15, 0.3), float2(0.5, 0.05)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.5, 0.05), float2(0.85, 0.3)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.85, 0.3), float2(0.85, 0.7)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.85, 0.7), float2(0.5, 0.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.5, 0.95), float2(0.1, 1.25)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.1, 1.25), float2(0.1, 1.7)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.1, 1.7), float2(0.5, 1.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.5, 1.95), float2(0.9, 1.7)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.9, 1.7), float2(0.9, 1.25)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.9, 1.25), float2(0.5, 0.95)));
    }
    else {
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.15, 1.85), float2(0.5, 1.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.5, 1.95), float2(0.82, 1.65)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.82, 1.65), float2(0.9, 1.0)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.9, 1.0), float2(0.9, 0.4)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.9, 0.4), float2(0.6, 0.05)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.6, 0.05), float2(0.25, 0.1)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.25, 0.1), float2(0.08, 0.45)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.08, 0.45), float2(0.2, 0.85)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.2, 0.85), float2(0.55, 0.95)));
        m = min(m, sdseg(q, float2(0.55, 0.95), float2(0.88, 0.7)));
    }
    return 1. - smoothstep(.09, .16, m);
}
// Signed number with one decimal (|val| < 100), top-left at o, digit height h.
float number(float2 p, float2 o, float h, float val) {
    float w = h * .5;
    float adv = w * 1.45;
    float2 s = p - o;
    float a = abs(val);
    float t10 = floor(a * 10. + .5);
    float hund = floor(t10 / 100.);
    float ones = mod(floor(t10 / 10.), 10.);
    float tenth = mod(t10, 10.);
    float lit = 0.;
    if (val < -.049) lit = 1. - smoothstep(.09, .16, sdseg(s / w, float2(.1, 1.), float2(.8, 1.)));
    lit = max(lit, digit((s - float2(adv, 0.)) / w, hund > .5 ? hund : -1.));
    lit = max(lit, digit((s - float2(2. * adv, 0.)) / w, ones));
    float dd = length(s - float2(2. * adv + w * 1.25, h * .93));
    lit = max(lit, 1. - smoothstep(h * .07, h * .11, dd));
    lit = max(lit, digit((s - float2(2. * adv + w * 1.5, 0.)) / w, tenth));
    return lit;
}

// @frame

const float MT = 22.;
const float MB = 186.;
const float MH = 164.;
// Meter fill shared with the EB BlackStrip meters: blue, light blue, amber near the top, red at the very top.
float3 ramp(float t) {
    float3 c = mix(float3(.22, .52, .82), float3(.42, .74, .95), smoothstep(0., .75, t));
    c = mix(c, float3(.98, .60, .16), smoothstep(.78, .88, t));
    return t > .93 ? float3(.95, .32, .20) : c;
}
float3 numcol(float v, float lim) {
    return v > lim ? float3(.98, .52, .14) : float3(.42, .74, .95);
}
float3 meterpx(float2 p, float3 color, float x0, float x1, float lvl, float pk, float ln) {
    if (p.x >= x0 && p.x < x1 && p.y >= MT && p.y <= MB) {
        float lv = (MB - p.y) / MH;
        color = float3(.040, .042, .048);
        if (lv < lvl) color = ramp(lv);
        if (abs(mod(lv * 6., 1.)) < .03 && lv > .01 && lv < .99 && lv >= lvl) color = float3(.10, .12, .14);
        if (abs(lv - pk) < .006 && pk > .01) color = float3(1., .62, .16);
    }
    if (ln >= 0. && p.x >= x0 - 3. && p.x < x1 + 3. && abs(p.y - (MB - ln * MH)) < 1.2) color = float3(.30, .68, .92);
    return color;
}

float dbg(float d) { return pow(10., d / 20.); }
float todb(float v) { return 20. * log(max(v, .000001)) / log(10.); }
float3 grbarpx(float2 p, float3 color, float x0, float x1, float lvl, float pk, float3 red) {
    if (p.x >= x0 && p.x < x1 && p.y >= MT && p.y <= MB) {
        float lv = (p.y - MT) / MH;
        color = float3(.040, .042, .048);
        if (lv < lvl) color = red;
        if (abs(lv - pk) < .008 && pk > .01) color = float3(1., .80, .50);
    }
    return color;
}

// A drum hit's envelope over 0..1 of the window: a short rise, then an exponential tail.
float hit(float t) {
    return t < .05 ? t / .05 : exp(-(t - .05) * 3.6);
}

half4 main(float2 fragCoord) {
    // 56 x 51 grid units -> 224 x 204 design units.
    float2 p = fragCoord / iResolution.xy * float2(224., 204.);
    float3 color = float3(.060, .064, .072);
    float3 grid = float3(.150, .160, .175);
    float3 blue = float3(.30, .68, .92);
    float3 red = float3(.98, .52, .14);
    float3 txt = float3(.80, .82, .84);

    float av = audioLow.x * 2. - 1.;
    float sv = audioLow.y * 2. - 1.;
    float gnow = audioLow.z * 36. - 18.;

    color = meterpx(p, color, 6., 30., audioLow.w, audioMedium.x, -1.);
    color = meterpx(p, color, 194., 218., audioMedium.y, audioMedium.z, -1.);

    // Live gain change, from the centre: up (blue) for more, down (amber) for less.
    if (p.x >= 172. && p.x < 184. && p.y >= MT && p.y <= MB) {
        float lv = (MB - p.y) / MH * 2. - 1.;
        float gn = gnow / 18.;
        color = float3(.040, .042, .048);
        if (lv >= 0. && lv < gn) color = blue;
        if (lv < 0. && lv > gn) color = red;
        if (abs(lv) < .012) color = grid * 1.6;
    }

    // A hit before (grey) and after (blue) shaping.
    if (p.x >= 36. && p.x <= 166. && p.y >= MT && p.y <= MB) {
        color = float3(.038, .046, .056);
        float t = (p.x - 36.) / 130.;
        float gy = (MB - p.y) / MH;
        for (int i = 1; i < 5; i++) {
            if (abs(gy - float(i) / 5.) < .004) color = grid;
        }
        float e = hit(t);
        float wa = 1. - smoothstep(.04, .20, t);
        float ws = smoothstep(.10, .45, t);
        float gdb = av * 9. * wa + sv * 9. * ws;
        float es = e * dbg(gdb);
        float y0 = e / 1.9;
        float y1 = min(es / 1.9, .99);
        if (gy < y0) color = color * .6 + float3(.10, .11, .12) * .7;
        if (gy < y1) color = color * .65 + float3(.05, .10, .16) * .55;
        if (abs(gy - y0) < .006) color = float3(.36, .38, .41);
        if (abs(gy - y1) < .011) color = float3(.50, .76, 1.);
    }

    float ipk = audioMedium.x * 60. - 60.;
    float opk = audioMedium.z * 60. - 60.;
    if (number(p, float2(8., 6.), 10., ipk) > .5) color = numcol(ipk, -.1);
    if (number(p, float2(196., 6.), 10., opk) > .5) color = numcol(opk, -.1);
    if (number(p, float2(158., 6.), 10., gnow) > .5) color = gnow < -.05 ? red : (gnow > .05 ? blue : txt);
    // Captions (shared frame): meters and bars in the bottom row, the header readout's name beside it.
    color = caption(p, color, 18., 9., 14., 0., 0., 0.);
    color = caption(p, color, 178., 7., 1., 9., 14., 0.);
    color = caption(p, color, 206., 15., 21., 20., 0., 0.);
    return half4(half3(color), 1.);
}
